		"&7&oNo world below. Every block of soil is one you made.&r"
		""
		"&6&lHow&r"
		"&7Fill a &6Barrel&7 with &aleaves&7, &asaplings&7, &aseeds&7 or &fsilkworms&7 and wait: it composts into &f&lDirt&r&7."
		""
		"&c&lThis is your bottleneck.&r"
		"&7Sieving &ndestroys&r&7 dirt, and every new row of crops wants more. &e&lRun several barrels from the start.&r"
	]
