	quest.077230AF1BABDBFA.quest_desc: [
		"&7Grinding levels one click at a time gets old. &a&lPixelGO AutoBattle&r&7 picks your move for you."
		""
		"&e&lTOGGLE"
		"&f&lV&r&7 by default. Chat tells you whether it is &a&lenabled&r&7 or &c&ldisabled&r&7."
		""
		"&e&lHOW IT CHOOSES"
		"&7&l- &f&lStrongest damaging move&r&7 - the default, it estimates real power"
		"&7&l- &f&lFirst damaging move&r&7 - fastest, and dumbest"
		"&7&l- &f&lFixed slot&r&7 - always move 1, 2, 3 or 4"
		""
		"&7Everything else lives in &a&lMods &8> &aPixelGO AutoBattle &8> &aConfigure&r&7: the delay between turns, whether it starts enabled, whether it announces itself in chat."
		""
		"&c&lIt will not switch Pokemon and it will not throw balls. &7Turn it off for anything that matters."
	]
