	quest.07BDB78BC053D025.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lNo Poké Ball on this page is craftable on a bench any more.&r"
		""
		"&7Every lid now comes out of a &bMekanism&7 &6Pressurized Reaction Chamber&7. Pixelmon's own three-apricorn lid recipe has been &nremoved&r&7."
		""
		"&6&lTwo routes, always&r"
		"&7- &e&lBench&r&7 — the Chamber makes the lids, you assemble the ball on a crafting table."
		"&7- &b&lCombiner&r&7 — the machine does the assembly. It costs a little more, but it runs without you."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7The full chain, machine by machine, is in the &6&lBall Line&r&7 chapter. Come back here once your Reaction Chamber is running."
	]
