		"&7This ball used to cost &fone Tumblestone&7 and three silver bases — and it came out &nby three&r&7. That was, without exaggeration, free Master Balls."
		""
		"&a&lOutput: one ball.&r &7Polonium comes out of a &5fission reactor&7 — there is no other source. If you can make this ball, you have already built the hardest machine in Mekanism. Catching a legendary should cost something."
	]
