	quest.12BBB7B981004450.quest_desc: [
		"&7The Pokémon arrives wearing one of its &5alternate skins&7. Purely cosmetic — and the cheapest ball of the special group for exactly that reason."
		""
		"&c&lIt no longer asks for a Skin Swapper.&r &7It used to, and that made the ball pointless: the Swapper already re-skins a Pokémon you have caught, so you would always have thrown an Ultra Ball and used the item. The ball now starts from a &fblank white shell&7 instead, dyed at random — no Swapper involved, and the two are independent."
