		"&7The diamond mesh keeps the ore chunks but &adrops far less junk&7: the same block sieved gives noticeably more."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7Pair it with a &fCompressed Sieve&7 and an automatic feed — a whole compressed block is sieved in one go."
	]
	quest.16607E930E8A84F9.quest_subtitle: "&7Tier 5 — the best rates"
	quest.16607E930E8A84F9.title: "&e&lDiamond Mesh"
