	quest.217406789143114E.quest_desc: [
		"&7Right click the Gate. That is the whole of it."
		""
		"&c&lYou need at least one Pokemon able to fight. &7No party, no entry - the Gate tells you so and stays shut."
		""
		"&7A title appears on screen with the rank and the level range you are walking into. &c&lRead it. There is no other difficulty warning."
		""
		"&e&lBEFORE YOU STEP THROUGH"
		"&7&l- &7Heal your party. There is no Pokecenter inside."
		"&7&l- &7Bring balls. Everything in there can be caught."
		"&7&l- &7Bring revives. Being knocked out ends the run."
		"&7&l- &7Clear some inventory space for the chests."
	]
