	quest.292BED81EFE0223D.quest_desc: [
		"&7Whatever you catch arrives with a &nmaxed&r&7 Speed EV spread: &f252&7 points, the per-stat cap."
		""
		"&7&fAdd EV SPEED&7 comes from &fCarbos&7 — the vitamin that trains this exact stat — infused with redstone in the &bMetallurgic Infuser&7. Pixelmon feeds Mekanism, Mekanism makes the ball."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7EVs are capped at &f510 total&7. Two maxed stats is the whole budget — pick the two that matter and do not waste a third ball."
	]
	quest.292BED81EFE0223D.quest_subtitle: "&7252 EVs, the instant it is caught"
	quest.292BED81EFE0223D.title: "&e&lEV Speed Ball"
	quest.2959473A399F6FAA.quest_desc: [
		"&b&lThe Alloy Smelter&r &7fuses up to three ingredients into one alloy. Without it, nothing else in this chapter exists."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7It also works as a vanilla furnace and it can smelt &fFused Quartz&7 and &fClear Glass&7."
