		"&b&lGrow it faster&r"
		"&8· &f&lCrouch&r &7next to your crops — &aSquatGrow&7 forces growth in a &e7x7&7 around you"
		"&8· &fBone meal&7 comes from sieving &fDust&7 — free, and unlimited"
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7Wheat, carrot, potato, pumpkin, melon, cactus, cane, cocoa and mushrooms &aall sell&7. Seeds sell too, for less."
