	quest.39962F9692B0C0C7.quest_desc: [
		"&7The base is the bottom half of the ball."
		""
		"&7Four metals, four tiers: &fIron&7 for the common balls, &7Silver&7 for the standard ones, &bPlatinum&7 for the strong ones, &6Wooden&7 for everything from Hisui."
