	quest.3AD1713C5EFB9564.quest_desc: [
		"&7The caught Pokémon has &f31 Sp. Attack IV&7 — the maximum. IVs cannot be trained away or improved without Hyper Training, so this is permanent perfection on one stat."
		""
		"&7&fAdd IV SP. ATTACK&7 costs &f4 Calcium&7 and a &bdiamond infusion&7 in the Metallurgic Infuser. Two per batch of three lids."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7Catch the same species repeatedly with different IV balls and breed the results — the &fDestiny Knot&7 passes five IVs down."
	]
