	quest.3DCC93742DAB1733.quest_desc: [
		"&7&lThere is only one balance.&r&7 What you win in a Pixelmon battle, what a quest hands you and what you make from selling items all go to the same place."
		""
		"&e&lHOW TO EARN"
		"&7&l- &7Beat wild Pokemon and trainers"
		"&7&l- &7Sell items, with &b/pixelsell&7 or the &a&lSell&r&7 button"
		"&7&l- &7Quest rewards, right through this book"
		"&7&l- &7Clear &d&lGates&r&7 and sell what the chests give you"
		""
		"&e&lHOW TO SPEND"
		"&7The &6&lShop&r&7 chapter and the &b&lPortable Shop&r&7 both draw on that balance."
		""
		"&c&lSome things are only ever sold, never crafted. &7Minion tools, the PixelGO Poke Balls and PixelGO Items have no recipe at all. Money is the only way in."
	]
