	quest.3DD05F31CD9769EF.quest_desc: [
		"&b/pixelgate &7is the administrative side of the system. &c&lThe whole command requires permission level 2&r&7, so an ordinary player cannot run any part of it - not even leave."
		""
		"&b/pixelgate open &8<rank> &8- &7force a Gate open where you stand"
		"&b/pixelgate list &8- &7every dungeon currently running: rank, players, Pokemon left, and which boss"
		"&b/pixelgate leave &8- &7pull yourself out of the dungeon you are in"
		"&b/pixelgate verify &8- &7build one dungeon of every rank and report the numbers"
		""
		"&7&overify is the one to run after changing the config. It tells you, per rank, how many rooms and Pokemon actually got built and how long it took."
	]
