	quest.47BAD1FE91D29C11.quest_desc: [
		"&7Catch rate &fx1&7, and the Pokémon gains &dfriendship twice as fast&7."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7The fastest way to a friendship evolution (Golbat, Riolu, Eevee...)."
