	quest.48BD7125BB932999.quest_desc: [
		"&7&oNine hammers, welded into something unreasonable.&r"
		""
		"&a&lIt works on compressed blocks&r &7— nine by nine of the real thing — so one swing does the work of &e&l81&r&7."
