	quest.58F99C4C400A3D87.quest_desc: [
		"&d&lS&r&7 is the top of the ladder, and the only rank with &c&lno cap on base stats at all&r&7. Anything in the game can show up, at any size."
		""
		"&e&lPOKEMON"
		"&7Level &f&l80 to 100&r&7. No base stat limit."
		"&c&lLegendary bosses are allowed."
		""
		"&e&lDUNGEON"
		"&7&l- &f&l16&r&7 Pokemon in total"
		"&7&l- &f&l4 to 7&r&7 combat rooms"
		"&7&l- &f&l4&r&7 elite guards"
		"&7&l- &7an &f&lultimate&r&7 tier boss"
		""
		"&e&lHOW OFTEN"
		"&7Weight &f&l300&r&7 of &f&l10000&r&7 - &a&l3%&r&7 of all natural Gates, one in &f&l33&r&7."
		""
		"&e&lIN THE CHESTS"
		"&7Sixteen to twenty four Ultra Balls at a time. Beast Balls, Cherish Balls - and the ball pool is rolled &f&lthree times&r&7 per chest, which works out to roughly &d&lone chest in six holding a Master Ball&r&7."
		"&7Full restores, max revives, max elixirs. Eight to twelve rare candies. Ability capsules and &d&lability patches&r&7, comet shards, relic gold, gold bottle caps, PP Max, lucky eggs, exp shares, and &5&lDynamax Candy&r&7."
	]
	quest.58F99C4C400A3D87.quest_subtitle: "&dOne natural Gate in thirty three"
	quest.58F99C4C400A3D87.title: "&d&lRank S"
