	quest.5F83826EC9EE7226.quest_desc: [
		"&7Two recipe viewers are installed and both work. Use whichever you prefer."
		""
		"&e&lTHE TWO KEYS THAT MATTER"
		"&f&lR &8- &7&lhow do I make this?"
		"&f&lU &8- &7&lwhat is this used for?"
		""
		"&7Hover any item, anywhere, and press one. &a&lThis answers more questions than any wiki."
		""
		"&e&lALSO WORTH KNOWING"
		"&7&l- &7Shift click a recipe to pull the ingredients straight out of your inventory"
		"&7&l- &f&lJade&r&7 names the block you are looking at, at the top of the screen"
		"&7&l- &f&lPolymorph&r&7 asks which recipe you meant when two of them collide"
		"&7&l- &7Several items in this pack carry a long explanation in their tooltip. Read them."
	]
