	quest.64467187D11B081C.quest_desc: [
		"&7&oWhy sieve one block when you can sieve nine?&r"
		""
		"&7It takes &fcompressed blocks&7 instead of single ones."
		""
		"&a&lOne swing sieves nine blocks.&r &7The single biggest time saver of the early game."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7Craft compressed blocks with &6Polymorph&7 open, so you can pick the Ex Compressum recipe over the vanilla one."
