	quest.6E8A1FA1C6EA2AE6.quest_desc: [
		"&7Silver is the metal of the &nmid-tier&r&7 balls: &9Great&7, &3Dive&7, &eFast&7, &dLove&7, &bNet&7 and the rest of the water tier."
		""
		"&6&lWhere every Pixelmon ore comes from&r"
		"&7Not one of them spawns on a skyblock, so all &fseven raw ores&7 were added to the &6Ex Deorum&7 sieve:"
		"&7- &fGravel&7 -> &7Silver&7, &fBauxite&7, &bPlatinum&7 (rare), &fTumblestone&7 (rare)"
		"&7- &fSand&7 -> &fSilicon&7, &bSky Tumblestone&7 (rare)"
		"&7- &8Crushed Deepslate&7 -> &7Silver&7, &fBauxite&7, &fSilicon&7, &bPlatinum&7"
		"&7- &8Crushed Blackstone&7 -> &8Black Tumblestone&7 (rare)"
		""
		"&7Metals go to a &ffurnace&7; the three tumblestones to a &f&lstonecutter&r&7. The nine &6Hisui&7 balls and the &fOrigin Ball&7 had NO source at all before this."
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7Three ingots make &f5 bases&7, and one base goes into every ball. Silver is the resource you will run out of first — put a minion on it."
	]
	quest.6E8A1FA1C6EA2AE6.quest_subtitle: "&7The metal half of a Poké Ball"
	quest.6E8A1FA1C6EA2AE6.title: "&7&lSilver Ingot"
	quest.6EB06C7C3CF7DC32.quest_desc: ["&7A Meteorite is an item that can change a &d&lDeoxys&r&7's form when used on the &d&lDeoxys&r&7. It can only be used on a &d&lDeoxys&r&7 owned by the player using the Meteorite. The Meteorite can be used an infinite number of times to change a &d&lDeoxys&r&7's form."]
