		""
		"&c&lLocked behind the wall.&r"
		"&7&fFlower Pots&7 now need the &d&lHarvest Certificate&r&7."
		""
		"&a&lThe certificate is never consumed&r&7, so once you own one the pots are cheap again — expand as wide as you like."
